### VectorService - Pure ML API
### Stateless embedding generation service
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: application/json

### Generate Embedding from Text
POST {{baseUrl}}/embed
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Smart Tivi Samsung 4K 55 inch"
}

### Generate Product Embedding
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/embed
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "test-product-001",
  "name": "Smart Tivi LG LED 4K 43 inch",
  "description": "Bo xu ly AI, man hinh 4K, HDR10+",
  "old_price": 11990000,
  "discount_percentage": 31,
  "category_name": "Tivi",
  "brand_name": "LG",
  "tags": [
    {"name": "Kich co", "value": "43 inch"},
    {"name": "Do phan giai", "value": "4K"}
  ]
}

### Batch Embed Multiple Texts
POST {{baseUrl}}/batch/embed
Content-Type: application/json

[
  "Smart Tivi Samsung 4K",
  "Laptop Gaming ASUS ROG",
  "iPhone 15 Pro Max"
]

### Health Check (detailed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json
